      <article id="evaluation" class="fcard reveal" style="--tint:var(--emerald)">
        <span class="fcard-kicker">Question papers &amp; answer-sheet evaluation</span>
        <div class="fcard-copy">
          <h3>Set the paper, read the class back</h3>
          <p>Pick chapters, weightage and difficulty — the question paper, blueprint and answer key are drafted for your syllabus, with your notes and subject books tuning every question.</p>
          <p>When the exam is written, photograph the answer sheets with the mobile app. Every answer is checked against its question and scored on your rubric — the same way for every student — and each result lands on that student's record. You review, adjust, approve.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fcard-visual">
          <div class="q-line"><b style="color:var(--emerald)">&#9998;</b>Paper set &middot; Ch 4&ndash;5 &middot; blueprint + answer key<span>&#10003;</span></div>
          <div class="q-line"><b style="color:var(--emerald)">&#10003;</b>Q1 &middot; Laws of reflection<span>5/5</span></div>
